name: Native observations retain exact source revisions through historical review and exports
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NODE_OPTIONS=--import=@REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/deny_provider_transport.mjs KUZUSHI_TEST_DENIED_FETCH_LOG=@ART/denied-fetch.jsonl
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/native_source_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET/owned
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/open-original.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Owned baseline public example 0 | baseline-source
expect: AKIAIOSFODNN7EXAMPLE
expect: Owned baseline public example 0
expect-not: Owned later public example 0
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/native_source_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART later
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/native_source_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART remove
paste-file: @ART/open-original.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Owned baseline public example 0 | original-source-after-removal
expect: AKIAIOSFODNN7EXAMPLE
expect: Owned baseline public example 0
expect-not: Owned later public example 0
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 20 receipts/first.env:2 | retained-source-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 20 receipts/first.env:2 | retained-source-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 20 receipts/first.env:2 | retained-source-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 20 receipts/first.env:2 | retained-source-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 receipts/first.env:2 | retained-source-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: retained-source-detail-1-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: retained-source-detail-2-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: retained-source-detail-3-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: retained-source-detail-4-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: retained-source-detail-5-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/native_source_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART narrow
ask: Does the exact older generation remain identifiable and readable at every size after the source SHA changes and its live file is removed, without substituting current bytes or claiming a fix?
resize: 120x36
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/native_source_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restore
submit: runs diff source-baseline source-later
require-live-snap: 25 SEEN AGAIN | source-comparison
expect: Absence does not establish a fix.
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 25 7cac9e253984 | source-revisions
expect: c557cdbf94b9
expect: dirty
ask: Does comparison disclose both recorded Git revisions and dirty state while separating recurrence from current applicability?
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/open-current-0.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 receipts/first.env:2 | current-first
submit: decision fp Owned public credential example is intentional inert text
require-live-snap: 25 recorded: rejected_false_positive | first-fp
paste-file: @ART/open-current-1.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 receipts/second.env:2 | current-second
submit: decision deferred Owner will review this second public example separately
require-live-snap: 25 recorded: deferred | second-deferred
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Scope: workspace history | report
keys: j j j
require-live-snap: 20 format json (4/6) | json-format
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 EXPORTED | report-export
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/native_source_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART export
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/native_source_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART final
ask: Does Report preserve both explicit decisions and export current source identities plus older relationship endpoint sources in all five formats without model work or inferred fixes?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NODE_OPTIONS=--import=@REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/deny_provider_transport.mjs KUZUSHI_TEST_DENIED_FETCH_LOG=@ART/denied-fetch.jsonl NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET/owned
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/open-original.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Owned baseline public example 0 | restarted-original-source
expect: AKIAIOSFODNN7EXAMPLE
expect: Owned baseline public example 0
expect-not: Owned later public example 0
expect: Decision source check
expect: different recorded observation
expect-not: after an earlier false-positive decision
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Scope: workspace history | restarted-report
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/native_source_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain exact historical source reading, all four observations, both decisions and the exported source history without changing focus unexpectedly?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
